#: ../../tools/gtopdb_tools.rst:113 ba461ff790134d0ea7167d8a30cbd946
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the Guide to Pharmacology database (GtoPdb) for "
"drug targets including GPCRs, ion channels, nuclear receptors, enzymes, "
"transporters, and catalytic receptors. Returns target IDs, names, "
"abbreviations, types, and family classifications. GtoPdb is the "
"IUPHAR/BPS reference resource for pharmacological drug targets with 3000+"
" curated targets. No authentication required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/gtopdb_tools.rst:117 4e01a9806f994373b9c18853124b57ce
msgid ""
"``name`` (string, null) (optional) Target name or gene symbol to search. "
"Examples: 'dopamine', 'serotonin receptor', 'EGFR', 'beta-adrenoceptor', "
"'TRPV1'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/gtopdb_tools.rst:120 82a75775fc064675b92cacc6b0516f45
msgid ""
"``type`` (string, null) (optional) Target type filter. Values: 'GPCR', "
"'Ion channel', 'Nuclear receptor', 'Enzyme', 'Transporter', 'Catalytic "
"receptor'"
msgstr ""

